{"ticker":"SRE","updated":"2026-10-30T23:14:00Z","profile":{"longName":"Sempra","shortName":"DBA Sempra","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Diversified","country":"United States","website":"https://www.sempra.com","fullTimeEmployees":15938,"marketCap":56274661376,"trailingPE":24.872831,"forwardPE":15.53539,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.1524987,"pegRatio":0.76,"targetMeanPrice":97.42105,"targetHighPrice":118.0,"targetLowPrice":83.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.001,"earningsGrowth":0.713,"grossMargins":0.43994,"operatingMargins":0.28328,"profitMargins":0.16824,"totalRevenue":13552000000,"beta":0.56,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":101.04,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":76.21,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.06},"summary":"Sempra engages in the regulated utilities business in the United States and Mexico. It operates through three segments: Sempra California, Sempra Texas Utilities, and Sempra Infrastructure. It also invests in and operates electric and gas utilities and other energy infrastructure that provides energy services to customers. The Sempra California segment provides natural gas and electric services to Southern California and part of central California. As of December 31, 2025, it offered electric services to approximately 3.6 million population and natural gas services to approximately 3.3 million population that covers 4,100 square miles. This segment owns and operates a natural gas distribution, transmission, and storage system that supplies natural gas. As of December 31, 2025, it served a population of 21.3 million covering an area of 24,000 square miles. The Sempra Texas Utilities segment engages in the regulated electricity transmission and distribution utility business. As of December 31, 2025, transmission system included approximately 18,418 circuit miles of transmission lines; 1,333 transmission and distribution substations; interconnection to 230 third-party generation facilities totaling 63,670 MW; and distribution system included more than 4.1 million points of delivery and consisted of 127,398 circuit miles of overhead and underground lines. The Sempra Infrastructure ","summary_zh":"Sempra 在美國和墨西哥從事受監管的公用事業業務。它透過三個部門運作：Sempra California、Sempra Texas Utilities 和 Sempra Infrastructure。它還投資和營運電力和天然氣公用事業以及其他為客戶提供能源服務的能源基礎設施。 Sempra California 部門為南加州和加州中部的部分地區提供天然氣和電力服務。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，它為約 360 萬人口提供電力服務，為約 330 萬人口提供天然氣服務，覆蓋面積 4,100 平方英里。該部門擁有並經營供應天然氣的天然氣分配、傳輸和儲存系統。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，它為 2,130 萬人口提供服務，覆蓋面積 24,000 平方英里。 Sempra Texas Utilities 部門從事受監管的輸電和配電公用事業業務。截至2025年12月31日，輸電系統包括約18,418電路英里的輸電線路； 1,333個輸配電變電站；與 230 個第三方發電設施互連，總容量為 63,670 兆瓦； Sempra 基礎設施","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 多元化","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":82.0,"h":83.24,"l":81.58,"c":82.89,"v":4127400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":82.45,"h":82.97,"l":81.36,"c":82.23,"v":3238900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":82.6,"h":82.98,"l":81.28,"c":82.12,"v":3601800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":82.07,"h":82.37,"l":80.46,"c":81.11,"v":4311500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":81.4,"h":81.4,"l":78.97,"c":79.41,"v":4818200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":79.15,"h":80.82,"l":79.15,"c":80.32,"v":4025600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":80.38,"h":82.21,"l":80.22,"c":82.01,"v":3727700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":82.0,"h":83.58,"l":81.75,"c":83.47,"v":4779600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":83.3,"h":84.32,"l":83.11,"c":83.94,"v":3204800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":84.03,"h":85.22,"l":83.32,"c":83.39,"v":5775400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":83.2,"h":83.6,"l":82.57,"c":82.7,"v":4362900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":83.27,"h":84.0,"l":82.57,"c":82.65,"v":6866000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":82.32,"h":82.93,"l":81.72,"c":82.48,"v":5866300},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":82.96,"h":83.58,"l":82.37,"c":83.2,"v":9015600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":82.57,"h":83.0,"l":81.98,"c":82.37,"v":6043700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":85.0,"h":86.8,"l":83.71,"c":86.05,"v":7570800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":86.41,"h":87.36,"l":86.12,"c":87.28,"v":4580500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":87.17,"h":87.65,"l":86.06,"c":8